WEBVTT

1
00:00:13,580 --> 00:00:16,180
Your gold box is red. What is your ability?

2
00:00:17,090 --> 00:00:18,970
My art is rebirth

3
00:00:20,940 --> 00:00:21,900
You said rebirth

4
00:00:22,180 --> 00:00:24,300
Resurrection after death or going back to the past?

5
00:00:24,580 --> 00:00:25,860
My mother and I both died once

6
00:00:26,140 --> 00:00:29,140
When I woke up, I went back to the last round before Mohs happened.

7
00:00:29,380 --> 00:00:30,740
Tang Hongqiang's family entered our residence

8
00:00:30,860 --> 00:00:33,300
My mother and I both died in this round

9
00:00:33,460 --> 00:00:34,780
We prepared a safe house in advance

10
00:00:35,020 --> 00:00:37,940
Do you know how many times you can be reborn? I don’t know.

11
00:00:38,100 --> 00:00:41,220
I don’t know if we will go back to the same time next time.
